---
// Floating control bar (Scroll to Top)
---

<aside aria-label="Quick Actions" class="fixed bottom-6 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-50 bg-surface-elevated/90 backdrop-blur-xl border border-neutral-100 px-6 py-3 rounded-full shadow-2xl flex items-center gap-4 text-xs font-text select-none">
  <span class="font-semibold flex items-center gap-2">
    <span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-primary animate-pulse" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    PulsarOS Bittenfruit
  </span>
  <span class="text-on-surface-muted" aria-hidden="true">|</span>
  <button id="btn-scroll-top" type="button" aria-label="Scroll to top of page" class="text-on-surface-muted hover:text-on-surface-default transition-colors font-medium cursor-pointer">Scroll to Top</button>
</aside>
